<title>USA: Mercury Finance buys back 624,700 shares.</title>
<headline>Mercury Finance buys back 624,700 shares.</headline>
<dateline>LAKE FOREST, Ill. 1996-11-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Mercury Finance Co said Monday it repurchased 624,700 shares of common stock in the week ended November 1.</p>
<p>The auto finance company is authorized to repurchase up to nine million shares over the next two years under its current stock repurchase program.</p>
<p>The company said it had 173 million shares outstanding when the plan was approved in late October.</p>
<p>--Reuters Chicago newsdesk, 312-408-8787</p>
</text>
